---
const componentId = 'ch19-force-decomposition';
---

<figure class="chapter-visual force-decomposition" id={componentId}>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>力的来源分解 | Decomposing an electronic-structure force</strong>
    <span>原创教学图：选择基组与自洽状态，观察哪些修正项在逻辑上仍需保留。</span>
    <span lang="en">Original teaching diagram: choose the basis and self-consistency state to see which corrections remain logically necessary.</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="force-decomposition__controls">
    <label>
      基组 | Basis
      <select data-basis>
        <option value="fixed-complete">固定且完备 | fixed and complete</option>
        <option value="fixed-finite">固定但有限 | fixed but finite</option>
        <option value="moving" selected>随离子移动 | coordinate dependent</option>
      </select>
    </label>
    <label>
      电子态 | Electronic state
      <select data-scf>
        <option value="stationary">充分定态 | stationary</option>
        <option value="residual" selected>存在 SCF 残差 | finite SCF residual</option>
      </select>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 860 330" role="img" aria-labelledby={`${componentId}-title ${componentId}-desc`}>
    <title id={`${componentId}-title`}>电子结构力的四类贡献</title>
    <desc id={`${componentId}-desc`}>总力由 Hellmann–Feynman 主项、基组移动产生的 Pulay 项、非局域赝势或投影算符导数，以及未充分自洽的残差项组成。控件改变需要保留的项。</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id={`${componentId}-arrow`} viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="currentColor" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <rect class="node node--total" x="330" y="24" width="200" height="62" rx="10" />
    <text x="430" y="50" text-anchor="middle">总离子力</text>
    <text x="430" y="72" text-anchor="middle" lang="en">total ionic force</text>

    <g class="branch branch--hf" data-branch="hf">
      <path class="connector" d="M430 86 L125 150" marker-end={`url(#${componentId}-arrow)`} />
      <rect class="node" x="25" y="155" width="200" height="78" rx="10" />
      <text x="125" y="182" text-anchor="middle">Hellmann–Feynman</text>
      <text x="125" y="205" text-anchor="middle">Hamiltonian 显式导数</text>
    </g>

    <g class="branch branch--pulay" data-branch="pulay">
      <path class="connector" d="M430 86 L330 150" marker-end={`url(#${componentId}-arrow)`} />
      <rect class="node" x="230" y="155" width="200" height="78" rx="10" />
      <text x="330" y="182" text-anchor="middle">Pulay</text>
      <text x="330" y="205" text-anchor="middle">基函数/子空间随坐标变化</text>
    </g>

    <g class="branch branch--nonlocal" data-branch="nonlocal">
      <path class="connector" d="M430 86 L535 150" marker-end={`url(#${componentId}-arrow)`} />
      <rect class="node" x="435" y="155" width="200" height="78" rx="10" />
      <text x="535" y="182" text-anchor="middle">非局域算符导数</text>
      <text x="535" y="205" text-anchor="middle" lang="en">nonlocal operator derivative</text>
    </g>

    <g class="branch branch--residual" data-branch="residual">
      <path class="connector" d="M430 86 L740 150" marker-end={`url(#${componentId}-arrow)`} />
      <rect class="node" x="640" y="155" width="200" height="78" rx="10" />
      <text x="740" y="182" text-anchor="middle">定态残差</text>
      <text x="740" y="205" text-anchor="middle" lang="en">SCF/stationarity residual</text>
    </g>

    <text x="430" y="284" text-anchor="middle">灰化表示该选择下此项按定义消失；不表示其在所有实现中可忽略。</text>
    <text x="430" y="307" text-anchor="middle" lang="en">A faded branch vanishes under the selected definition; it is not universally negligible.</text>
  </svg>

  <p class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite" data-readout>
    当前选择：移动基组且电子态未完全定态，因此 Pulay 与残差项都必须检查；非局域项是否存在由 Hamiltonian 表示决定。
  </p>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>输入：</strong>基组对核坐标的依赖；电子态是否达到变分定态。</p>
    <p><strong>输出：</strong>逻辑上可能存在的力项，不给出具体材料的数值大小。</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>选择“固定且完备 + 充分定态”时，Pulay 与残差分支应灰化；非局域分支仍保持，因为它与基组完备性不是同一问题。</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>该图不是任何代码的力实现，也不能由分支数量判断误差大小。</p>
  </div>

  <noscript>
    <div class="force-decomposition__fallback">
      <strong>无 JavaScript 说明 | No-JavaScript fallback</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>Hellmann–Feynman：Hamiltonian 对核坐标的显式导数。</li>
        <li>Pulay：有限基组或变分子空间随核坐标变化。</li>
        <li>非局域项：非局域赝势、投影算符等对象的显式导数。</li>
        <li>残差项：轨道或密度未达到所用能量泛函的定态点。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </noscript>
</figure>

<script define:vars={{ componentId }}>
  const root = document.getElementById(componentId);
  if (root) {
    const basis = root.querySelector('[data-basis]');
    const scf = root.querySelector('[data-scf]');
    const readout = root.querySelector('[data-readout]');
    const pulay = root.querySelector('[data-branch="pulay"]');
    const residual = root.querySelector('[data-branch="residual"]');

    const update = () => {
      const pulayActive = basis.value === 'moving';
      const residualActive = scf.value === 'residual';
      pulay?.classList.toggle('branch--inactive', !pulayActive);
      residual?.classList.toggle('branch--inactive', !residualActive);

      const basisText = basis.options[basis.selectedIndex].text;
      const scfText = scf.options[scf.selectedIndex].text;
      const pulayText = pulayActive ? 'Pulay 项必须检查' : '该定义下 Pulay 项消失';
      const residualText = residualActive ? '定态残差必须检查' : '定态残差按定义消失';
      readout.textContent = `当前选择：${basisText}；${scfText}。${pulayText}；${residualText}。非局域项仍由 Hamiltonian 表示决定。`;
    };

    basis?.addEventListener('change', update);
    scf?.addEventListener('change', update);
    update();
  }
</script>

<style>
  .force-decomposition__controls {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem, 1fr));
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .force-decomposition__controls label {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .force-decomposition svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    min-width: 42rem;
  }

  .force-decomposition {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .node {
    fill: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
    stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .node--total {
    fill: var(--sl-color-gray-5);
  }

  .connector {
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.7;
  }

  text {
    fill: currentColor;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .branch {
    transition: opacity 160ms ease;
  }

  .branch--inactive {
    opacity: 0.24;
  }

  .force-decomposition__fallback {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    padding-top: 0.8rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 50rem) {
    .force-decomposition svg {
      min-width: 38rem;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .branch {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
